   "kind": "result",
   "section": "3.7",
   "name": "Momentum eigenfunctions",
   "type": "wavefunction",
   "statement": "e^{ikx} and e^{−ikx} are eigenfunctions of the momentum operator with eigenvalues +ħk and −ħk, waves moving right and left; the sine of a particle in a box is a combination of the two."
  },
  {
   "id": "quantum-uncertainty",
   "kind": "definition",
   "section": "3.8",
   "name": "Uncertainty of an observable",
   "symbol": "dA",
   "terms": [
