   ],
   "statement": "Separating ψ = X(x)Y(y)Z(z) turns the 3D box into three 1D boxes: ψ is a product of three sines and E = (h²/8m)(nₓ²/Lₓ² + n_y²/L_y² + n_z²/L_z²).",
